{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026IOFwSSUpAu1795750395.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>屯門昨晚（26日）便發生一宗驚險交通意外，一輛私家車在良景輕鐵站附近失控剷入草叢，距離輕鐵路軌僅一欄之隔。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-27-11h23m17s611.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026CBPzRgZvrz1795750348.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>根據網上流傳的一段短片顯示，昨晚有一輛白色私家車在經過屯門良景輕鐵站附近時，駛入右彎期間突然失控，直剷衝入路邊草叢，並緊貼鐵欄停下，險些撞入旁邊的輕鐵路軌。上載車Cam片的網民亦在帖文留言表示：「啱啱經過見到，嚇到我個心離一離。架車應該要報銷。」</p><p><p><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-27 at 11.06.41.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026tHaq1i0PVL1795750356.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>警方表示，於26日晚上8時27分接獲涉事私家車司機報案，指駕車期間失控撞入草叢，幸事件中無人受傷。</p><p><p><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-27 at 11.06.42.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026qCcmmUt3d41795750364.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:37:49.446544+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":227,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T03:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T07:40:31.448578+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:31:13.876293+00:00","content_hash":"efdb94ffbed4bd0176cadde9709bb07994a329063f7a825de730710506d364d7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:37:49.446544+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}